# Cloudflare Workers static assets: extra response headers.
# CSS is served as plain "text/css" with no charset, and the built CSS holds
# non-ASCII characters (icon-font glyphs). Without a declared charset a
# browser can decode them wrong (Wild Magnolia's review stars showed as
# "â˜…"), so declare UTF-8 explicitly. 2026-10-16.
/_astro/*.css
  Content-Type: text/css; charset=utf-8
